[38;2;124;124;124mLet me prove the standard theorem: d(T, K(H)) = ||π(T)||.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mProof: ||π(T)|| = inf{||T - K|| : K ∈ K(H)} by definition of the quotient norm. [0m[38;2;124;124;124mThe quotient norm on B(H)/K(H) is exactly inf{||T - K|| : K ∈ K(H)}.[0m

